{"4146500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Reforest", "steam_appid": 4146500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/523bd8162138b9a994be5745d494e28a.avif?t=1773153065\" width=256 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, atmospheric 2.5D puzzle-platformer where you control a robot that travels through different scenarios, passing through sectors dominated by machines that have awakened consciousness after the absence of human presence in an apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/3589fbb4ea38497e7fb9f23b61596bb9.poster.avif?t=1773153065\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/3589fbb4ea38497e7fb9f23b61596bb9.webm?t=1773153065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic environment, much of the cities, underground bunkers, and even military installations have been taken over by independent machines whose sole purpose is the destruction of anything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/ab80aa353bf88369e83f0cf96e7b3eea.avif?t=1773153065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras_big/ab80aa353bf88369e83f0cf96e7b3eea.webp?t=1773153065 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/57a02ac510722c2e37eb0ed50434cee3.poster.avif?t=1773153065\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/57a02ac510722c2e37eb0ed50434cee3.webm?t=1773153065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/57a02ac510722c2e37eb0ed50434cee3.mp4?t=1773153065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines exploration, physics-based puzzles with some stealth elements. Manipulate levers, place gears in their proper places, while dodging drones and other security systems with powerful weapons, among other things the robot will face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/fda71b159d0fddec7dde290cd679b7f8.avif?t=1773153065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras_big/fda71b159d0fddec7dde290cd679b7f8.webp?t=1773153065 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/3da96fa11aab78aabbb1f374110e6ca3.avif?t=1773153065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras_big/3da96fa11aab78aabbb1f374110e6ca3.webp?t=1773153065 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the robot's job to solve puzzles, discover which creatures will pursue it or which ones might help it find what would be the last hope for humanity, which is no longer on Earth but rather searching for a habitable planet.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/523bd8162138b9a994be5745d494e28a.avif?t=1773153065\" width=256 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, atmospheric 2.5D puzzle-platformer where you control a robot that travels through different scenarios, passing through sectors dominated by machines that have awakened consciousness after the absence of human presence in an apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/3589fbb4ea38497e7fb9f23b61596bb9.poster.avif?t=1773153065\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/3589fbb4ea38497e7fb9f23b61596bb9.webm?t=1773153065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic environment, much of the cities, underground bunkers, and even military installations have been taken over by independent machines whose sole purpose is the destruction of anything that moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146500/extras/ab80aa353bf88369e83f0cf96e7b3eea.avif?t=1773153065\" data-big-src